<!-- ═══════════ HERO ═══════════ -->
<header class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="overline">Premium mathematics &nbsp;·&nbsp; Grades 1–12 &nbsp;·&nbsp; JEE · CAT · CTET · IMO</div>
  <h1>Mathematics,<br><span class="it">beautifully mastered.</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Worksheets, case studies and sample papers where <b>every single question is solved step by step</b> — crafted for CBSE, ICSE and India's toughest exams, delivered to your device in seconds.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a class="btn-solar" href="/shop">Explore the Library →</a>
